1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:29,980
To be continued...

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:45,400
30 years ago, an unprecedented disaster called a spatial quake assaulted our world.

3
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:50,400
The female lifeforms which caused them were called spirits,

4
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:54,340
but whether the catastrophes were unintentional or planned was unclear.

5
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:58,860
The very existence of these spirits was kept secret from the public.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,240
But I, Shido Itsuka, know all about them.

7
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,980
Go on! You've got it tasted, Shido!

8
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:13,560
There's no need to be shy! Come on, eat it!

9
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:17,500
And this is what?

10
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:19,800
It's stew. Obviously.

11
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:24,760
We each had different ideas about what we should make for you, so we just combined them all.

12
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:30,640
Well, I really appreciate the thought. What the heck did you put in there to make it look like that?

13
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:36,800
We kind of went all out this time. Everyone got together and tossed in their favorite foods.

14
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,620
Oh, well, that's incredibly thoughtful.

15
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:44,460
Isn't that just the most wonderful thing you've ever heard of?

16
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,640
Go on, eat some while it's still hot!

17
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:55,880
Hey, Coterie, you should contribute, too. Go ahead and make a little offering to the banquet.

18
00:01:55,880 --> 00:02:10,160
Oh, we keep making it better and better!

19
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,200
And the color is even more beautiful!

20
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:30,240
Holy crap!

21
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,460
Well, how is it?

22
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,360
Surprisingly good.

23
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,020
Yay!

24
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:35,760
Look at you!

25
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:46,060
See, I knew Yuzuru's fried chicken would be able to tie all those flavors together.

26
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:51,320
Negative. It was Kaguya's pork cutlet that did it. It's what made the broth so savory.

27
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:53,680
What? Nah, it was your chicken.

28
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:57,600
No way. It was Kaguya's. You two will never change, will you?

29
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:02,440
Maybe we should just recognize it as the miraculous collaboration that it is and leave it at that.

30
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:06,600
On TV, they said stew's good no matter what you put in it, and now we know it's true!

31
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:11,260
Miraculous is right. For something that looks like this to end up being edible at all.

32
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:16,600
Such a bummer that Miku couldn't be here to join us for dinner. Just part of being an idol, I guess.

33
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:17,780
Oh, darling!

34
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:19,940
He rang!

35
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:23,960
Surprise!

36
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:28,780
I heard you calling out to me through the ether. I couldn't resist, so here I am!

37
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,720
Miku Izuyo's spirit idol has now arrived.

38
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:32,520
Miku?

39
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:35,260
Wait. How are you singing live on TV?

40
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:37,800
Oh, please. That was pre-recorded.

41
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:39,940
Anyway, what are you crazy bunch up to?

42
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:43,060
It kind of looks like a party with all of you together like this.

43
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:43,740
Oh!

44
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:47,080
As a matter of fact, now that I think of it, today's actually my birthday.

45
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:51,760
Don't worry. All I want from each one of you is a great big kissy-wissy.

46
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,700
What are you doing?

47
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:55,800
Defense. Kaguya barrier.

48
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:56,520
Wait!

49
00:03:56,520 --> 00:04:01,140
Stop, Miku! Get right back inside that TV!

50
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:02,900
Come on, don't be shocked!

51
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:05,740
You're still the Kaguya barrier.

52
00:04:05,740 --> 00:04:06,740
You're still the Kaguya barrier.

53
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:25,800
Oh, now I get it. So that's why you're eating such a strange-smelling stew.

54
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:31,400
Yeah. Anyway, it's really good to have you here, Miku. Here you go. Careful, though. It's pretty hot.

55
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:35,940
My, it really is a unique color. Well, here goes nothing.

56
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:40,360
Are you okay? That's why I warned you.

57
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:45,040
Oh, darling. You'll never believe this, but I seem to have burned my poor lips.

58
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:48,120
I'm afraid unless you kiss them, they won't ever heal.

59
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:55,760
I know what you're trying to do, Miku. That's not even how burns work.

60
00:04:56,020 --> 00:05:02,400
My lips hurt, too. Such pain. It seems I've also been burned by stew. I think I require urgent care.

61
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,240
Hey, no bear!

62
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:06,760
Hey, Shido, don't forget Yoshido's lips.

63
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:13,320
Shido! Look at that! I accidentally burned my lips, too.

64
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,400
You guys, come on.

65
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:16,560
My brother!

66
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,820
I think I did too, for real!

67
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:22,160
Why'd your ribbons just turn white?

68
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:25,100
Aw, I hope everyone's gonna be okay.

69
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:29,740
Don't you worry, I know the perfect thing to make you all feel better right away.

70
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,300
Hey!

71
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,200
Hmm?

72
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:39,120
What? Origami?

73
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:40,900
I've prepared a stew for you, too.

74
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:42,600
Wow, did you really?

75
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,780
Uh, thanks a lot.

76
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:51,940
The body parts from a turtle, scorpion, and seal, boiled in an energy drink.

77
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:56,900
Next time we meet, please tell me your thoughts on how you liked it.

78
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:08,620
So, though rife with culinary drama, life is actually pretty good right now.

79
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:09,880
Shido.

80
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:10,720
Shido.

81
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:10,800
Shido.

82
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,320
It's time.

83
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,420
Let's get on with the next state, then, shall we?

84
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:23,380
You all set down there?

85
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:24,480
Yep.

86
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,520
Whenever you're ready.

87
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:35,140
What a weird place.

88
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:36,680
It's so creepy.

89
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:41,340
This park has been completely abandoned ever since the Great Spatial Quake.

90
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:46,240
It's just far enough away from the redevelopment that it's remained untouched to this day.

91
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:49,960
So, it's just as it was 30 years ago.

92
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:55,620
The spirit we tracked moved from the Spatial Quake's origin site to somewhere around that area.

93
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:59,420
You need to make contact before the AST shows up.

94
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,020
Roger that.

95
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,120
The heck?

96
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,020
What is it?

97
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:10,880
Strange buildings for a park.

98
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:13,160
This can't be what it used to look like, right?

99
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:16,520
It's faint, but we are detecting some spirit waves.

100
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:19,840
Everything you're seeing was manifested by a spirit's powers.

101
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,320
Are you hearing that?

102
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,060
Shido.

103
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,800
The spirit we're after is close by for sure.

104
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:25,840
Oh.

105
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,700
What a rare sight.

106
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:32,660
Usually when I'm pulled here, I never run into anyone but the AST.

107
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:34,640
So, this is a pleasant surprise.

108
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:53,920
There's nothing for you to be afraid of.

109
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,240
It's not like I'm going to eat you or anything.

110
00:07:56,660 --> 00:07:58,720
Uh, no, I'm just...

111
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,500
Hey, you're actually kind of cute, aren't you?

112
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,580
What are you doing in a place like this?

113
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:07,500
Aren't there alarms that warn you to take shelter whenever a spirit appears?

114
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,700
Well, yeah, but...

115
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:10,820
Shido, our choices!

116
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:17,080
Everyone, decide!

117
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:21,480
Well, this one was pretty straightforward.

118
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:23,540
It's gotta be one, right?

119
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,760
Without knowing her temperament, it makes sense to keep it direct.

120
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:27,860
Wrong!

121
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:29,580
We should go with choice number two.

122
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,400
This spirit's a big sister type.

123
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:35,120
You might not expect it, but Shido can really tickle those maternal instincts.

124
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:35,920
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

125
00:08:36,380 --> 00:08:38,160
I'll admit there's some truth to that.

126
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,280
Though I'm kind of shocked.

127
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,280
Not a single person chose option three.

128
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:44,720
I thought I could at least count on Kamazuki to pick it as a joke.

129
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:47,060
Alas, her boobs bounce too much.

130
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,600
My tastes tend to veer toward the budding ones.

131
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,940
Now, if we were talking about licking the back of her knee, I might have to reconsider.

132
00:08:52,940 --> 00:09:06,060
What's the matter, young one?

133
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:10,840
Uh, well, I, um, the thing is, I don't really know.

134
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,660
I barely escaped.

135
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:14,780
Then I ended up here.

136
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:17,540
Oh, is that so?

137
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,420
What's your name, love?

138
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:20,800
Shido Itsuka.

139
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:22,240
Shido, then.

140
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,960
That's a really cute name.

141
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:26,480
You can call me Natsumi.

142
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:30,500
Although some of you humans prefer calling me witch if what I hear is correct.

143
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,100
Hello, Miss Natsumi.

144
00:09:32,540 --> 00:09:33,900
That sounds so formal.

145
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,300
Natsumi is fine.

146
00:09:36,900 --> 00:09:37,760
Come here, Shido.

147
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:41,480
Big sis here wants to ask you a little something special.

148
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,460
So may I?

149
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:45,340
Sure, yeah, go ahead.

150
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:47,900
What do you think?

151
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:49,380
Do you find me pretty?

152
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,440
Well, yeah.

153
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,880
I think you're very pretty.

154
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,060
Yes, knew it!

155
00:09:56,260 --> 00:09:57,120
Tell me this.

156
00:09:57,760 --> 00:10:00,680
Specifically, what is it you find pretty about me?

157
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,060
Let's see.

158
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,720
Your sparkling eyes.

159
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:05,940
The way your nose is so straight.

160
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,900
Your cool, feminine style.

161
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:08,820
Love that.

162
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:09,500
Keep going.

163
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:11,620
Your hair.

164
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,420
It looks so silky.

165
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,600
Yes!

166
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:16,880
Shido kid, you're right on the money.

167
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:26,640
I was right.

168
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:29,760
I knew that this me was beautiful.

169
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,380
Shido!

170
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:33,560
A.S.T.

171
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:34,080
Incoming!

172
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:36,660
Oh, dear.

173
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:41,900
This is bad.

174
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:43,860
You'll be okay.

175
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,780
Let's get to work.

176
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,280
Pondale!

177
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,520
This is so weird.

178
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,260
Take this!

179
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:12,460
Huh?

180
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:25,640
Let's go, Shido.

181
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:27,920
I think we should escape while we still can.

182
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:31,820
You're gonna keep giving your big sis lots more compliments, though, aren't you?

183
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:33,080
Uh, yeah.

184
00:11:33,340 --> 00:11:35,300
I don't mind doing that, but...

185
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:49,040
The surveillance camera stopped working.

186
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:49,960
We're on it.

187
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,060
Didn't see that coming.

188
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,560
You okay, Natsumi?

189
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:58,180
Shido, this is not good.

190
00:11:58,500 --> 00:12:00,860
Natsumi's happiness meter is currently plummeting.

191
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:04,440
You saw, right?

192
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:05,580
Huh?

193
00:12:05,900 --> 00:12:07,280
Don't try to play dumb.

194
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,560
I know you saw my...

195
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,580
Unforgivable.

196
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:14,400
And you won't get away with it.

197
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:16,340
Shido Ichika!

198
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:17,940
Heed my words.

199
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,940
Your life is about to be over!

200
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:33,600
Why the heck did she just fly off like that?

201
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,220
Hmm...

202
00:12:34,220 --> 00:12:36,220
Hmm...

203
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:56,160
Wow, it's already lunchtime?

204
00:12:56,160 --> 00:13:00,620
I didn't expect those strategy meetings for dealing with Natsumi would go all night.

205
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:10,320
Hey, what's up?

206
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,940
How dare you show your face, Shido Ichika?

207
00:13:12,940 --> 00:13:15,400
You seriously have zero shame, don't you?

208
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,980
That is so lame!

209
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:18,660
I don't understand.

210
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:20,200
What are you talking about?

211
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,060
You have some nerve playing dumb.

212
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:24,200
Making lewd passes at Sweet Eye.

213
00:13:24,620 --> 00:13:26,580
Embarrassing the hell out of Maya and me.

214
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:27,880
And not just that.

215
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:30,440
Even Touka was a victim of your heinous crimes.

216
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:31,860
That's so lame!

217
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:33,960
Wait, hold on a second.

218
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:37,220
First of all, I was busy this morning and just now got to school.

219
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,860
You should learn when to fess up.

220
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,400
Shido, listen.

221
00:13:40,660 --> 00:13:41,660
What's done is done.

222
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,220
But you shouldn't just pretend like it never happened.

223
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:45,300
Jeez.

224
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:48,080
At the very least, next time, give me a little heads up.

225
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:50,200
That way I can prepare myself a bit.

226
00:13:50,740 --> 00:13:51,400
No, look!

227
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:53,100
I'm telling you, I really did it!

228
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:55,580
Origami!

229
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:56,780
Please, don't tell me.

230
00:13:56,780 --> 00:13:58,640
I did something terrible to you, too!

231
00:13:59,120 --> 00:13:59,960
You did nothing.

232
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,540
Thank goodness.

233
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:09,920
What do you think you're doing, Origami Tomiichi?

234
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:12,080
Well, that was weird.

235
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,760
I thought you were glad that I didn't do anything before.

236
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,080
Right.

237
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,400
So I could have you do it right now.

238
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:19,980
Yes.

239
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:22,180
I want you to do those things to me, too.

240
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:24,120
Push me up against the wall.

241
00:14:25,100 --> 00:14:26,200
Lift up my chin.

242
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:30,380
Whisper sweet words in my ear while you gently lift my skirt.

243
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:35,040
Then we'll exchange a deep, romantic kiss.

244
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:38,260
You'll pull off my clothes, take my innocence as a woman.

245
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:42,620
Then you'll leave your everlasting mark on me, imbued within my body.

246
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:43,620
Hold on!

247
00:14:43,620 --> 00:14:44,320
Hold on!

248
00:14:44,580 --> 00:14:46,900
He hasn't done that stuff with anyone yet!

249
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:47,840
I'm yours, Shido.

250
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:49,300
Do it.

251
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:51,220
Look, this is kind of a lot.

252
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,100
Aha!

253
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:52,940
There you are!

254
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:54,000
I'll give you this.

255
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:56,160
It's a ballsy move, sticking around school.

256
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,120
Small warning.

257
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,920
You'll pay for what you've done here today.

258
00:14:59,340 --> 00:14:59,860
Oh, man.

259
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:00,640
Not you, too.

260
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:04,200
Are you saying I somehow managed to assault both of you as well?

261
00:15:04,260 --> 00:15:05,040
Feigning ignorance?

262
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,620
Let me tell you something.

263
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,800
If you don't give me those panties back, you're in trouble.

264
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,040
We hold grudges.

265
